# Add patterns of files dvc should ignore, which could improve
# the performance. Learn more at
# https://dvc.org/doc/user-guide/dvcignore

# The project scaffold ships a dvc.yaml but has no dataset of its own, so it
# must not be picked up by `dvc repro -P` / `dvc stage list -P`. A real project
# copied out of it is unaffected by this rule.
/projects/_template
